					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Hello again, friends.</p> <p>Please help me in giving a big round of applause to the French-speaking Wiki, who are this month's showcase. Their articles are among my favorite to read and translate, as they are full of witty commentary and interesting little lore bits that I can't help but find charming. I hope you enjoyed this article, as well as the following three that will be featured this month.</p> <p>Here's to our Francophonic friends!</p> 
				 	]]>
